        "description": "Retrieves the latest appointment from the Scheduling service.\n\n**Script**  \nThe post-response script saves the returned `appointmentId` as the collection variable `appointmentIdOld`.\n\nVerify that the returned appointment is the active appointment you intend to reschedule. Keep this ID unchanged afterward so the original appointment’s invoice can be queried.\n\n**Next step:** Reschedule appointment."
