        "description": "Reschedules the selected active appointment at the patient’s request.\n\nRun **Get the latest active appointment** first to populate the collection variable `appointmentIdOld`.\n\n**Request body**\n\n- `appointmentDate`: the requested new appointment date.\n    \n- `startTime`: the requested new start time.\n    \n- `cancelInitiator`: `PATIENT` for this scenario.\n    \n\nThe new slot must be available, fit within the doctor’s working hours, and not overlap an unavailable period.\n\n**Expected outcome**  \nThe original appointment is cancelled as part of rescheduling, and a replacement appointment is created for the requested slot.\n\n**Script**  \nThe post-response script saves the returned appointment ID as the collection variable `appointmentIdNew`, preserving `appointmentIdOld` for comparison.\n\n**Next steps:** Query **Get invoice status Old** and **Get invoice status New** to inspect the billing outcome for both appointments."
      },
