        "description": "Retrieves the invoice status for the original appointment after rescheduling.\n\n**Request**  \nUses the collection variable `appointmentIdOld` in the URL. No request body is required.\n\n**Expected outcome**  \nThe response shows how Billing handled the original appointment’s cancellation. The old appointment eventually is refunded if it was paid for or cancelled.\n\nProcessing is asynchronous. If the previous invoice state is still shown, wait briefly and query again.\n\n**Next step:** Get invoice status New."
