        "description": "Retrieves the invoice status for the replacement appointment created by rescheduling.\n\n**Request**  \nUses the collection variable `appointmentIdNew`, saved by the rescheduling request. No request body is required.\n\n**Expected outcome**  \nAfter Billing processes the replacement booking, the response contains a new invoice with `invoiceStatus: DRAFT`. Its `appointmentId` matches the replacement appointment.\n\nIn this example, the original invoice was refunded and a separate draft invoice was created for the replacement. The original payment was not transferred to the new invoice.\n\nInvoice creation is asynchronous. If it is not yet available, wait briefly and query again.\n\nCompare the response’s `appointmentId` with the replacement appointment ID to confirm that the invoice belongs to the new booking."
      },
